- STRANGE DEATH OF A LITTLE GOAT --                                               |

      Between the dates of the 27th and 31st of July of the current year, at the __UFO_PROTECTED_000__ Farm, a strange incident occurred that left the local community in a state of confusion and concern. A young goat, seemingly healthy and well-cared for, was found dead under mysterious circumstances. The exact cause of its death remains unknown, sparking speculation and curiosity among the residents.
